<p>Try this:</p>
<pre class="lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
    &lt;head&gt;
        &lt;title&gt;How to build a search box?&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;/head&gt;
    &lt;body&gt;
        &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; class=&quot;search&quot; placeholder=&quot;Search&quot;&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yap You Can Use Placeholder&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;
